{
 "info": {
  "name": "Tamagotchi Go — Monster Raid",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
  "description": "Monster Raid service (localhost:8084) in the Lab 1 Compose deployment. Set seedPassword locally; tokens come from User Management and membership from Guild. The requests use the raids that Monster Raid seeds: the practice raid of the schedule Package Registry seeds, open for 30 days, and the fixture raid that Alice and Bob won. Runs repeatably: Alice joins the practice raid once and attacks it on every run, and Bob stays out of it. Package Registry starts and cancels raids over mutual TLS on the internal port, which is not published on the host, so those routes are not in this collection."
 },
 "item": [
  {
   "name": "Login alice",
   "request": {
    "method": "POST",
    "header": [
     {
      "key": "Content-Type",
      "value": "application/json"
     }
    ],
    "url": "{{users}}/v1/auth/login",
    "body": {
     "mode": "raw",
     "raw": "{\"email\": \"alice@demo.invalid\", \"password\": \"{{seedPassword}}\"}",
     "options": {
      "raw": {
       "language": "json"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "event": [
    {
     "listen": "test",
     "script": {
      "type": "text/javascript",
      "exec": [
       "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200));",
       "if(pm.response.code===200){const b=pm.response.json();pm.environment.set(\"aliceToken\",b.accessToken);pm.environment.set(\"aliceId\",b.user.id);}"
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
